From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
Subject: [PATCH] RootEncoder 2.8.1: report per-target EGL output submission results

This patch is staged, not applied to the app dependency in this checkpoint. It
targets the exact RootEncoder 2.8.1 source paths recorded in the master audit.

The callback reports EGL submission only. It does NOT claim MediaCodec has
consumed/encoded the buffer, nor that RTMP transmitted the encoded frame.

